Package: forensicR
Title: Crime Scene Documentation and Reconstruction Tools
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karine", "Quadros", , "kquadros@dgso.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Allan", "Quadros", , "allanvcq@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Tools for crime scene investigators: scene mapping from field
    measurements (baseline, triangulation, polar), shooting reconstruction
    from bullet defects, structured evidence and custody logging, and
    reproducible scene reports rendered to Word, PDF or HTML.
